.TH "AG\-CLI\-PR\-LIST" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-pr\-list \- List pull requests
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli pr list [<owner>/<repo>] [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&List pull requests
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-assignee <string>\fR
\&Filter by assignee: @me for PRs assigned to you across all your repositories
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-author <string>\fR
\&Filter by author: @me for PRs you created across all your repositories
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
\&Output pull requests as JSON
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-L, \-\-limit <int>\fR
\&Maximum number of PRs to list
\&Default: \(dq30\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-review\-needed <string>\fR
\&Filter by requested reviewer: @me for PRs that need your review across all your repositories
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-review\-requested <string>\fR
\&Filter by requested approver: @me for PRs that need your approval across all your repositories
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-s, \-\-state <string>\fR
\&Filter by state: open, closed, locked, merged, all
\&Default: \(dqopen\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
